---
title: Custom .css theme
theme: brand.css
---

# Custom .css theme

This document sets `theme: brand.css`, a sibling stylesheet resolved relative to the
document and inlined after the base stylesheet, so a single `.css` file can restyle the
page without touching the framework or shipping a whole extension.

The same `theme:` key also resolves an installed `_extensions/<name>/theme.css` bundle by
bare name, and a `.scss` file is read verbatim (no compilation). A named `.css`/`.scss`
that cannot be read is reported as a `theme file not found` warning, while a bare name is
left unwarned (it may be a legacy built-in theme this build does not ship).
